review:
// TRANSMISSION INCOMING //

Docking request... 

We see your Spacebase is complete, erm, wait, are those citizens being sucked into space? We heard that you guys had big plans to get this thing up and running but it seems that you have a lumpy, kind of lopsided base... Oh well, it had promise but appears to have been partially abandoned with only a token staff left behind to keep the raiders and pirates away. Hopefully there will be a crew out there willing to get in back into order before it enters the atmosphere of some celestial body out there.

// TRANSMISSION TERMINATED //
